 en:{add:"+ Widget",trading:"Trading layout",blank:"Blank canvas",smart:"Smart ×",big:"Big ×",abs:"Absorb ×",
  vwap:"VWAP",kzTip:"Sessions + Kill Zones (NY time): live session boxes (Asia/London/NY) that freeze into H/M/L lines (high/low = resting liquidity, raids flagged) + REJ signals (wick beyond range, close back inside, EMA9/21 aligned); kill-zone bands: Asia 20-24, London Open 02-05, NY AM 07-10, NY PM 13:30-16 (1H and lower)",setupmode:"Setup display",mLines:"Setup: lines",mBox:"Setup: box",tCur:"Select / move",tTrend:"Trend line",tH:"Horizontal line",tFib:"Fib retracement",indBvd:"Breakout Volume Delta",indEw:"Elliott waves (auto 1-2-3-4-5 / A-B-C)",bvdTip:"A close through a swing high/low, labelled BUY/SELL % (who was stronger inside the breakout bar) or ⚠ weak. Uses live trade delta when available, otherwise the close position inside the bar (~).",auto:"Auto",manual:"Manual",lockTip:"Auto: price scale follows the candles. Manual: the scale stays where you set it (drag / wheel on the price axis).",indVol:"Volume (colour by delta)",openDot:"Open Depth of Market",closeDot:"Close Depth of Market",ofSet:"Depth of Trade settings (colours, sizes)",indDot:"Order flow: sweep ◆ / absorption ⊗ dots",dotTip:"Sweep = diamond, absorption = ring with cross (dashed line to its target). Same buy/sell colours as the bubbles, depth map and Time & Sales.",indDot3:"Depth of Trade (bubbles + DOM + dots + BUY/SELL)",dot3Tip:"Turns the whole order-flow view on or off at once",indBub:"Order flow: bubbles (big prints)",bubTip:"Circle per large trade, size = volume, green = buys / red = sells (⚙ for colours and size). Builds from live trades.",indDom:"Order flow: depth heat-map (DOM)",domTip:"Resting bid/ask liquidity behind the candles, heat = size. Builds from the live order book while the chart is open.",indMk:"Order flow: BUY/SELL markers + targets",indFp:"Footprint candles (sell × buy per price)",fpTip:"Per price inside each candle: sells (hit bid) × buys (lifted ask), POC outlined, 3:1 imbalances bold. Builds from live trades while the chart is open; zoom in for the numbers.",indDelt