trength",sgNone:"no signals match the filters",sgCount:"signals",sgScan:"scan",sgAlert:"alert",sgTiming:"Timing",tmNow:"at entry",tmWait:"waiting",tmRun:"running",tmLate:"late - do not chase",tmStop:"stop hit",tmTp:"TP1 hit",tmNA:"no price",sgTimeTip:"Timing layer: where price is now relative to the plan. at entry = within 0.25 R of the entry; waiting = not at the entry yet; running = in profit, under 50% of the way to TP1; late = 50%+ of the way to TP1 (chasing); stop / TP1 hit = already decided.",sgPipTip:"Forex plan with a 30-50 pip stop and a 120+ pip target (pip = 0.0001, JPY pairs 0.01)",
